    "encrypted": "false",
    "display_name": "School Bus Data",
    "long_instructions": "You’d like to convert the school bus data from [the spreadsheet](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1nG0AllhbooKilRVyj0_UVDh4WwD_eUYqL2wjPTQ7BnU/edit?usp=sharing) to a CSV file so that Python programs can more easily work with the data.\r\n\r\n**☑️ Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Populate `bus.csv` with data from at least three rows from the spreadsheet. Remember to also include a header row with column names!\r\n2. Press “Run” to see a visual representation of the CSV file and verify that it looks like what you expect.",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Create a CSV file for a school bus system.",
